addReserve('B1','double-pronouns','La mappa? ___ porto domani.','The map? I will bring it to you tomorrow.','Te la',['Te lo','Ti le']);
addReserve('B1','pronoun-request','Il libro? ___ puoi prestare per una settimana?','The book? Can you lend it to me for a week?','Me lo',['Me la','Te lo']);
